  cardText: "(stand-in until Grandma's own card is added)\n\nPickled Garlic\n\nFor each pint:\nA head of dill and a pinch of peppercorns\nPeeled cloves to fill it (about {cloves})\n\nThe same brine as pickles: water to the first line, vinegar to the top line, {salt} scoops of salt, brought to a boil.\n\nBrine up to the line on the jar. Lids on, {minutes} minutes in the water bath."
